                },
                {
                    "id": "d8366c12-352e-45a1-b0aa-e820c9162b86",
                    "notes": "This along with reload therapy will boost your survival by a lot.\nAt some point you should have enough bullets to not fully reload the gun and still fully heal you, never fully reloaded, never fully empty, this means in an emergency you can easily heal 20-30% health if you reload fully.\nOr if you have time, just shoot random bullets and reload to heal.",
                    "action": "buy",
                    "upgrade_id": "0ee48089-49a3-4980-a6f6-3d4b72585ead"
                },
                {
                    "id": "b6a08ab0-0b09-4096-a1ff-38815e7e69a6",
                    "notes": "If Money allows this but not \"Eye of the Spider\". This one is a goodie.",
                    "action": "optional",
                    "upgrade_id": "caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27"
                },
                {
                    "id": "35c62396-b33d-47d6-8a4c-d0f8bd7e6054",
                    "notes": "If money allows it, remove \"Talon modification module\" and get this.",
                    "action": "optional",
                    "upgrade_id": "bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b"
                },
                {
                    "id": "8e06148a-2e4e-4d87-9537-f50324a57bc3",
                    "notes": "Go this instead of \"Tripod\" if they go heavy on Shields and Armor, or simply if you feel like that's a problem",
                    "action": "optional",
                    "upgrade_id": "9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66"
                },
                {
                    "id": "e62fc624-e53e-4f6a-b040-c9fc79a98483",
                    "notes": "This is map dependent, if you don't constantly have high-ground maybe go with \"Shieldbuster\".",
